<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-soft-gradient position-relative overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="backdrop-glow"></div>
    <div class="container position-relative z-3">
      <div class="max-width-800 mx-auto">
        <span class="badge-category mb-3">My Philosophy</span>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-extrabold mb-4" style="color: #182033;">
          My Approach to <span class="text-primary-pink">Supportive Conversations</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-0">
          "Sometimes the most valuable thing you can offer someone is your time, attention and willingness to listen."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-divider">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-width-800 mx-auto mb-5 text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold">My 6 Core Pillars</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">How I approach every single voice call conversation to ensure you feel heard and supported.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- 1. I Listen First -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-primary-blue fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">01</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Listen First</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">My primary goal is to let you share without interruption. I make sure you have the space to voice your thoughts fully.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 2. I Try to Understand -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-purple fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">02</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Try to Understand</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">I pay attention to the details of your experiences and feelings, striving to see things from your point of view.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 3. I Don't Judge -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-primary-pink fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">03</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Don't Judge</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Every thought or emotion you share is valid. I provide a neutral, safe room where shame or blame do not exist.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 4. I Talk Through -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-primary-pink fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">04</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Talk Through the Situation</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Once you have spoken, we can discuss the situation together. Conversing about a problem often helps clear the fog.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 5. I Help Look at Steps -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-primary-blue fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">05</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Help Look at Next Steps</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">If you want suggestions, we can explore simple, practical paths together. I don't force advice, but help you find options.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- 6. I Encourage -->
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-light border-0">
            <span class="text-purple fw-bold display-6 mb-2 d-block">06</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3">I Encourage You Forward</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">I leave you with motivation and emotional warmth, encouraging you to step forward at your own comfortable pace.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Scope & Boundary Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <span class="badge-category mb-2">Scope of Service</span>
          <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">A Space to Talk, Not a Clinic</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">
            It's important to understand the boundary of our conversation. This service is created to simulate a warm, compassionate friend or trusted peer who is always available to talk.
          </p>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-sm-6">
              <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm">
                <h6 class="fw-bold text-success mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill me-2"></i> What I Provide</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0 d-grid gap-1">
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Active, caring listening</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Empathetic responses</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Friendly conversational care</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Respectful advice if requested</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-6">
              <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm">
                <h6 class="fw-bold text-danger mb-2"><i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill me-2"></i> What I Do Not Provide</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0 d-grid gap-1">
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Psychiatric medical diagnosis</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Psychological therapy</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Clinical prescriptions</li>
                  <li><i class="bi bi-dash"></i> Crisis suicide interventions</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="card-premium bg-white border-0 text-center">
            <i class="bi bi-chat-heart text-primary-pink fs-1 mb-3" style="color: #E91E8F;"></i>
            <h4 class="fw-bold">Sometimes sharing what you're feeling is the first step toward feeling better.</h4>
            <p class="text-muted small px-3">
              "A safe conversation can make a difficult day feel a little lighter. You do not have to carry everything alone."
            </p>
            <a href="/user/dashboard" class="btn btn-brand w-100 py-3 mt-3">Start a Conversation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
